{
  "_comment_top": "MCP 客户端配置示例。下方分别给出 Reasonix (DeepSeek) 与 Claude Code 两段，按你用的客户端二选一。API Key 只填在此处或目标机 .env，切勿提交。",

  "_section_reasonix": "────── Reasonix (DeepSeek 终端 agent) ──────",
  "reasonix_example": {
    "mcpServers": {
      "vision": {
        "command": "node",
        "args": ["/ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/vision-mcp-for-reasonix/dist/index.js"],
        "env": {
          "VISION_PROFILE": "zhipu",
          "VISION_API_KEY": "你的智谱key"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "_section_claude_code": "────── Claude Code (~/.mcp.json) ──────",
  "claude_code_example": {
    "mcpServers": {
      "vision": {
        "command": "node",
        "args": ["/ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/vision-mcp-for-reasonix/dist/index.js"],
        "env": {
          "VISION_PROFILE": "zhipu",
          "VISION_API_KEY": "你的智谱key"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "_notes": [
    "1) 把 /ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/vision-mcp-for-reasonix 换成实际安装路径。",
    "2) VISION_PROFILE 可选: zhipu | openai | qwen | local。",
    "3) 想换模型但不换供应商，加 VISION_MODEL 覆盖，例如 glm-4.6v-flash (免费)。",
    "4) 本地模型场景用 VISION_PROFILE=local，无需 apiKey。"
  ]
}
